                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty decent animal game, I'm 20 and still love animals and it's hard to find stuff anymore that doesn't take billions of hours of commitment. Though I do have to mention that the game has a few bugs. Though I do enjoy mushy animal games, I am still a gamer. This being true, I like to do everything possible that I'm not supposed to do. So here's something you might want to fix: I was walking along and saw a Hyena. I really like Hyena's they're my favorite animals, I noticed I could not interact with it, so I left it alone. Upon further examination I realized you could buy a tranquilizer gun, so being the little idiot I am, I decided to use it on the Hyena. Well I got the Hyena, but I don't think I was supposed to.\n\nShortly after I was bringing the Hyena back, I kept getting a notification saying the camp was mad because I had too many animals and had to release some. I'm thinking this might be a product of me doing something I wasn't supposed to. As soon as I got to camp my game crashed. I broke it. I broke the game. I can't get back on. Please save me.\n\nAlso please add more animals! If not a branch off game, or an expansion would be really cool! I haven't gotten too far, but correct me if they're already there. I'm guessing the theme is obviously african animals, and I think some wonderful additions would be: Crocodiles, African Wild Dog, Secretary Bird (even though that's just me wishing lol), Rhinoceros, Red River Hog (god I love them),  and Baboon.\n\nI've made it far enough to see: Zebra, Gazelle, Leopard, Lion, Giraffe, Elephant, Chimpanze, Hippo. \nNot sure if there are any more, but I hope so when I fix my broken game.",
